# Story page: tutorial
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = First Steps
---
{name} learned four things in quick succession: that apples are good, that rocks are rude, that purple walls are doors, and that red walls are the end of the conversation.

Learning is pleasant when the lessons are small. The lessons ahead are not small, and I did consider leaving this page out so that you would not get your hopes up.

At the end, a voice from nowhere pressed a spare life into {name}'s keeping and said, 'You will need this.' Voices from nowhere are never wrong about such things, which is the worst thing about them.
